{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52597","headline":"偈 二 · 慧能","name":"偈 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"心是菩提树，身爲明镜台。\n明镜本清净，何处染尘埃？\n（见敦煌本《南宗顿教最上大乘摩诃般若波罗蜜经六祖慧能大师於韶州大梵寺施法坛经》）（按：《全唐诗续补遗》卷二收惠能偈一首，原出於法海本《坛经》，与敦煌本异，今重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52597.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52597","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}